    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibaá nee faanqw oo waawuti'iimár Peka garmoó Remalia waawutmoó Israeliro, Ahasi garmoó Yotam waawutmoó Yuda waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/un kureeriiwós a mibeeri tsár. Inós baraá waawuti'iimaro kureeri ngaa /aáy mibaá nee lahhoó', baraá gixsár Yerusalemuro. Inós hhooeema gaa tleehhiiká dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, adoodár baabuúwós Daudi gaa tleehhiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala inós tlehhma'aá waawituú Israeli gina eehár. Inós sleeme tam na/aywós guna ilahhooár da/tá wa haniís. Inós tleehhmuudá' ta waki oo xoordá hatlaá' kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa guús geeraá múk Israelír wa ale guna tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Ahasi ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i nee mooyángw tsuú' gina hanmiís gawaá gongoamá wa ale, nee dír gamuú umuú xa'anoó naa/e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Resini waawutmoó Aramu nee Peka garmoó Remalia waawutmoó Israeli tana tláy tawa slaqwarár ay Yerusalemu. Inooín Ahasi nguna harweeriyé' ala ngwa baali'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarihe, waawutmoó Edomu gixsár Elati a tidá' aáng taa hayóh nee múk Yuda, gari ki/ís dír múk Edomu, múk Yuda kudá' baraadá' wa hoót guri guús. Múk Edomu tari dáh, nee tari hoót Elatír wa alé ay laarí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi muu guri ya/aáw amór waawutmo Tiglat-pileseri oo Ashuru iwa kaahi, «Aníng a sagadiyusmoowók oo inkihhimuú koóm, qwaláng tu/áng baraá dabaá waawutmoó Aramuwo nee oo Israeliwo kudá' aníng iga i haraatlaye'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi peésaadár baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, nee sahaábu, nee muruú baraá doó waawutmo, gari haniís tawa qeemuú waawutmoó Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiglat-pileseri firoodár Ahasi gari ya/án, gixsár Damasko gari i haraatláy nee ngiri hayóh. Waawutmo Resini oo Aramu guri gaás, muu guri ar tláy ay Kiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Ahasi iwa Damaskór káy as tiwa doogiya' nee waawutmo Tiglat-pileseri, iwa hardáh Damasko kitángw ilahhooa kay hanmaamisi guri ár amoodá' wa aleeró. Naagáy slaqsoó nee kudá' ti slawá' guri ya/aáw amór Uria kaahamusmoó Mungú as kitángw adór kudá' kuwa tleehhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uria kitángw ilahhooa guri tleéhh ar slaqsoó adór kudá', nee tleehhamoro guri hhe'eés dír waawutmo Ahasi nira amór dó' i ki/iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi niwa Damasko wa kií/ kitangwduú ilahhooa guri ár, iri tseewúy dír kitangwdá', ilahhooa gari haniís gawaadá' wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilahhooár da/a gari haniís, nee ilahhooár puuruhe. Ilahhooár muruú wahaangw gari tsipipi'iís, nee tseereedár ilahhooár wayda gari hikimiís gawaá kitangwdá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitangwduú ilahhooa aáng taa tleéhh ar muqslír sirdaa/aat, guri paraátl as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, guri hingeés, geeraá dó' wa alé, dír tla/ángw kitaangós kuduú ilahhooa nee Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, guri qaás bihhaá /iya awa kitaangós kuduú ilahhooa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmo Ahasi kaahamusmo Uria guri báy, «Kitaangwí úr ar gadiyuuseek as ilahhooár da/a ar matlaatle kawa gawaaká' wa hanmis. Nee ar tsiindo tidár puurú gawaaká' tiwa hanmis, nee ilahhooár da/a ar waawutmo nee ilahhooarós ar puuruhe, dinkwa nee ilahhooár da/a ar muu sleémeero oo baraá yaamuuká', nee ilahhooar'ín ar puuruhe nee ar muruú wahaango. Tseere sleémeero ar ilahhooár da/a nee ar ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i gawaaká' ti tsipipi'is. Ala kitángw taa tleéhh ar muqslír sirdaa/aat a kwe'eé' as Mungú nguwa yaahamiis.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmo Uria adoodá' waawutmo aa oó' gana eehár tleehharo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Ahasi waqsuudá' oo birika kay iwitiís guri tsaát, birika gari hingeés gawaá hikwaadá mibaá nee tsár awa muqslidá' sirdaa/aate, nee birikadá' kari iwitiís gawaá iihhaafirír tlaa/e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee matla/angwdá' taa tleéhh as deelór Sabaáto, kudá' taa tleéhh baraá doó waawutmo, nee afkú do'duú dahmaá baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, waawutmo guri hingeés dír doó AAKOÓ MUNGUHE as waawutmoó Ashuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' sleémeero awa waawutmo Ahasi aa tleéhh kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'aá waawituú Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi iri gwaá', kuri foól baraá /antaá waawitá kudá baraá gixsár Daudi, nee garmaawós Hesekia iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa aleeró.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
